<tr id="A1.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Component</span></th>
<th id="A1.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example for Text-only Event Detection (ED)</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T2.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Instruction</span></th>
<td id="A1.T2.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Please identify the trigger word and classify the events in the query into one or more appropriate categories based on the given choices. Then, output the trigger word, its position interval, and the option.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="A1.T2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Demonstrations</span></th>
<td id="A1.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">--- Example 1 (Positive) ---</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Sentence: Two Chicago police officers take a man into custody during a protest march.</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Answer: custody; [8,9]; (D)</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T2.2.3.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">&lt;Other demonstrations (positive and negative) are provided in the actual prompt.&gt;</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="A1.T2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Query</span></th>
<td id="A1.T2.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{sentence}</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="A1.T2.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Options</span></th>
<td id="A1.T2.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T2.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(A) Movement.Transport (B) Conflict.Attack (C) Conflict.Demonstrate (D) Justice.ArrestJail (E) Contact.PhoneWrite (F) Contact.Meet (G) Life.Die (H) Transaction.TransferMoney</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb"><span id="A1.T2.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Answer</span></th>
<td id="A1.T2.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A1.T2.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.2.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.2.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">&lt;placeholder&gt;</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Example of the few-shot prompt structure for the textual event detection (ED) subtask. The prompt includes a detailed instruction, contrastive demonstrations, and the final query for the model to complete. The structure is adapted for other subtasks, such as argument extraction.</figcaption>
</figure>
